    "class": "gps-550174192675324896 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=549541555719897919&sectionId=550174192675324896)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gOqpwUiqUBfXW_text","label":"gOqpwUiqUBfXW_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:32px;\"><strong>Why Do We Need Shilajit?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gNqnMsLyMxBdL_text","label":"gNqnMsLyMxBdL_text","default":"<p>If you feel mentally and physically drained, and it only seems to get worse with time, we have a treat for you...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>See, our Western diet lacks essential nutrients and minerals, which leads to widespread chronic health decline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This nutritional deficiency manifests in symptoms like brittle joints and bones, muscular weakness, low energy, and accelerated aging.<br><br>You've tried everything, and nothing seems to help. Why? Because it all starts with minerals...minerals you aren't getting in western foods.<br><br><i><strong>Shilajit provides a hyper-concentrated supply of 84 of 102 minerals that are essential for filling in these nutrient gaps.</strong></i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gCLdyyCXYoDSn_text","label":"gCLdyyCXYoDSn_text","default":"<strong>What Is Shilajit?</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gNOqGaKWEVvhF_text","label":"gNOqGaKWEVvhF_text","default":"<p>Shilajit is a sticky, dark, resinous substance found predominantly in the mountainous regions of the Himalayas. This compound is traditionally used in Indian medicine due to its dense mineral content and ability to heal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"goBuOZmeRZJUC_text","label":"goBuOZmeRZJUC_text","default":"<strong>Benefits For Men &amp; Women</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gwJHcCqBEjSJN_text","label":"gwJHcCqBEjSJN_text","default":"<p>Shilajit contains fulvic acid, a compound critical for absorbing minerals, detoxification, and antioxidant effects.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit contains two unique molecules that aren't found anywhere else in nature. These fascinating compounds contribute to its diverse effects and anti-inflammatory properties, potentially slowing the aging process.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gVFWKrJSvwMai_text","label":"gVFWKrJSvwMai_text","default":"A QUALITY SHILAJIT SUPPLEMENT CAN"},{"type":"html","id":"gRPPjmtjNHpGn_text","label":"gRPPjmtjNHpGn_text","default":"<p>SIow Down Aging</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gUBPZBMzfnAvA_text","label":"gUBPZBMzfnAvA_text","default":"Energy & Endurance"},{"type":"html","id":"gFxyHcjCtxcDt_text","label":"gFxyHcjCtxcDt_text","default":"Increase Strength"},{"type":"html","id":"gUJvTWTutWMbz_text","label":"gUJvTWTutWMbz_text","default":"Optimize Hormone Levels"},{"type":"html","id":"gDJblOJxcKbOE_text","label":"gDJblOJxcKbOE_text","default":"Increase Collagen Synthesis"},{"type":"html","id":"gPBIgnzkeIVHn_text","label":"gPBIgnzkeIVHn_text","default":"Increases Bone Density"},{"type":"html","id":"gLSvWVLPFBaAr_text","label":"gLSvWVLPFBaAr_text","default":"<strong>Doses &amp; Side Effects</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"giKpnStDcSLRy_text","label":"giKpnStDcSLRy_text","default":"<p>The recommended dosage depends on several factors, including age and if it's a resin or extract.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The internet recommends 250-500mg of resin per day...<strong>but that's not accurate, nor scientific - and the resin is impossible to measure. For this reason, I would avoid resin all together.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Only buy an extract!</p><p><br>The main thing you are looking for is a 70% fulvic acid ratio, which tells you how nutrient dense the extract is.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
